{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1778978890333,"sessionID":"ses_1cc99a625ffei0cFSQ4yg684Kg","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"webfetch","callID":"call_1cJk6UqoCxWbtUGhoQcxmXYO","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"url":"https://www.ebi.ac.uk/ols4/api/search?q=spiral%20prominence&ontology=uberon","format":"text","timeout":30},"output":"{\"response\":{\"docs\":[{\"iri\":\"http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/UBERON_0028194\",\"ontology_name\":\"uberon\",\"ontology_prefix\":\"UBERON\",\"short_form\":\"UBERON_0028194\",\"broad_synonyms\":[\"spiral prominence\"],\"description\":[\"A projecting portion of the spiral ligament of the cochlea, bounding the lower edge of the stria vascularis and containing within it a blood vessel, the vas prominens.\"],\"label\":\"spiral prominence of cochlear duct\",\"obo_id\":\"UBERON:0028194\",\"type\":\"class\",\"exact_synonyms\":[\"prominentia spiralis ductus cochlearis\",\"spiral prominence of cochlea\",\"spiral prominence of cochlear duct\"]},{\"iri\":\"http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/UBERON_0004066\",\"ontology_name\":\"uberon\",\"related_synonyms\":[\"forebrain prominence\",\"frontonasal mass\",\"frontonasal process\",\"prominentia frontonasalis\"],\"ontology_prefix\":\"UBERON\",\"short_form\":\"UBERON_0004066\",\"description\":[\"The unpaired embryonic prominence that is formed by the tissues surrounding the forebrain vesicle and develops into the forehead and bridge of the nose/snout.\"],\"label\":\"frontonasal prominence\",\"obo_id\":\"UBERON:0004066\",\"type\":\"class\",\"exact_synonyms\":[\"embryonic frontonasal prominence\"]},{\"iri\":\"http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/UBERON_0005867\",\"ontology_name\":\"uberon\",\"related_synonyms\":[\"mandibular process\",\"mandibular swelling\",\"prominentia mandibularis\"],\"ontology_prefix\":\"UBERON\",\"short_form\":\"UBERON_0005867\",\"description\":[\"The paired ventral prominences formed by bifurcation of the first pharyngeal arches in the embryo; the two prominences unite ventrally and fuse to form the mandible and lower lip.\"],\"label\":\"mandibular prominence\",\"obo_id\":\"UBERON:0005867\",\"type\":\"class\"},{\"iri\":\"http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/UBERON_0005868\",\"ontology_name\":\"uberon\",\"related_synonyms\":[\"prominentia maxilaris\"],\"ontology_prefix\":\"UBERON\",\"short_form\":\"UBERON_0005868\",\"description\":[\"The paired dorsal prominences formed by bifurcation of the first pharyngeal arches in the embryo that unite with the ipsilateral medial nasal process to form the upper jaw.\"],\"label\":\"maxillary prominence\",\"obo_id\":\"UBERON:0005868\",\"type\":\"class\",\"exact_synonyms\":[\"embryonic maxillary process\",\"maxillary process of embryo\",\"maxillary process\"]},{\"iri\":\"http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/UBERON_0034680\",\"ontology_name\":\"uberon\",\"ontology_prefix\":\"UBERON\",\"short_form\":\"UBERON_0034680\",\"description\":[\"A zone of thyroid cartilage formed by fusion of the two plate-like laminae of the cartilages.\"],\"label\":\"laryngeal prominence\",\"obo_id\":\"UBERON:0034680\",\"type\":\"class\",\"exact_synonyms\":[\"Adams apple\",\"Adam\\u0027s apple\"]},{\"iri\":\"http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/UBERON_0002277\",\"ontology_name\":\"uberon\",\"ontology_prefix\":\"UBERON\",\"short_form\":\"UBERON_0002277\",\"description\":[\"A concavity in the floor of the cochlear duct, formed by either the overhanging vestibular lip (inner spiral sulcus) or the spiral prominence and the spiral organ (outer spiral sulcus).\"],\"label\":\"spiral sulcus\",\"obo_id\":\"UBERON:0002277\",\"type\":\"class\",\"exact_synonyms\":[\"sulcus spiralis\"]},{\"iri\":\"http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/UBERON_0006725\",\"ontology_name\":\"uberon\",\"ontology_prefix\":\"UBERON\",\"short_form\":\"UBERON_0006725\",\"description\":[\"A spiral thickening of the fibrous lining of the cochlear wall. Spiral ligament secures the membranous cochlear duct to the bony spiral canal of the cochlea. Its spiral ligament fibrocytes function in conjunction with the stria vascularis to mediate cochlear ion homeostasis.\"],\"label\":\"spiral ligament\",\"obo_id\":\"UBERON:0006725\",\"type\":\"class\",\"exact_synonyms\":[\"ligamentum spirale ductus cochlearis\",\"spiral cochlear ligament\",\"spiral ligament of cochlea\",\"spiral ligament of cochlear duct\"]},{\"iri\":\"http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/UBERON_0010239\",\"ontology_name\":\"uberon\",\"ontology_prefix\":\"UBERON\",\"short_form\":\"UBERON_0010239\",\"description\":[\"A variant of the ascending colon in ruminants and pigs.\"],\"label\":\"spiral colon\",\"obo_id\":\"UBERON:0010239\",\"type\":\"class\",\"exact_synonyms\":[\"coiled colon\"]},{\"iri\":\"http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/UBERON_0004067\",\"ontology_name\":\"uberon\",\"related_synonyms\":[\"lateral nasal swelling\",\"prominentia nasalis lateralis\"],\"ontology_prefix\":\"UBERON\",\"short_form\":\"UBERON_0004067\",\"description\":[\"The lateral area of the two branches of a horseshoe-shaped mesenchymal swelling in the future nasal region of the embryo; it separates the olfactory pit from the developing eye and the ala of the nose/snout develops from it.\"],\"label\":\"lateral nasal prominence\",\"obo_id\":\"UBERON:0004067\",\"type\":\"class\",\"exact_synonyms\":[\"lateral nasal process\",\"latero-nasal process\"]},{\"iri\":\"http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/UBERON_0004068\",\"ontology_name\":\"uberon\",\"related_synonyms\":[\"medial nasal swelling\",\"nasomedial prominence\"],\"ontology_prefix\":\"UBERON\",\"short_form\":\"UBERON_0004068\",\"description\":[\"The central area of the two limbs of a horseshoe-shaped mesenchymal swelling that lie medial to the olfactory placode or pit in the future nasal region of the embryo; it joins with the ipsilateral maxillary prominence in the formation of half of the upper jaw, and the nasal tip and philtrum of the upper lip develop from it.\"],\"label\":\"medial nasal prominence\",\"obo_id\":\"UBERON:0004068\",\"type\":\"class\",\"exact_synonyms\":[\"medial nasal process\",\"medial-nasal process\",\"prominentia nasalis medialis\"]}],\"numFound\":96,\"start\":0},\"responseHeader\":{\"QTime\":143,\"status\":0},\"facet_counts\":{\"facet_fields\":{\"ontologyPreferredPrefix\":[\"UBERON\",\"96\",\"ADDICTO\",\"0\",\"ADO\",\"0\",\"AEO\",\"0\",\"AFO\",\"0\",\"AGRO\",\"0\",\"AISM\",\"0\",\"AMPHX\",\"0\",\"APO\",\"0\",\"APOLLO_SV\",\"0\",\"ARO\",\"0\",\"AfPO\",\"0\",\"BAO\",\"0\",\"BCIO\",\"0\",\"BCO\",\"0\",\"BFO\",\"0\",\"BMONT\",\"0\",\"BSPO\",\"0\",\"BTO\",\"0\",\"CAO\",\"0\",\"CARO\",\"0\",\"CCF\",\"0\",\"CCO\",\"0\",\"CDAO\",\"0\",\"CDNO\",\"0\",\"CHEBI\",\"0\",\"CHEMINF\",\"0\",\"CHIRO\",\"0\",\"CHMO\",\"0\",\"CIDO\",\"0\",\"CIO\",\"0\",\"CL\",\"0\",\"CLAO\",\"0\",\"CLO\",\"0\",\"CLYH\",\"0\",\"CMO\",\"0\",\"CMPO\",\"0\",\"COB\",\"0\",\"COLAO\",\"0\",\"COVOC\",\"0\",\"CPONT\",\"0\",\"CRO\",\"0\",\"CTENO\",\"0\",\"CVDO\",\"0\",\"DDANAT\",\"0\",\"DDPHENO\",\"0\",\"DHBA\",\"0\",\"DIDEO\",\"0\",\"DISDRIV\",\"0\",\"DMBA\",\"0\",\"DOID\",\"0\",\"DRON\",\"0\",\"DUO\",\"0\",\"EC\",\"0\",\"ECAO\",\"0\",\"ECO\",\"0\",\"ECOCORE\",\"0\",\"ECTO\",\"0\",\"EDAM\",\"0\",\"EFO\",\"0\",\"EMAPA\",\"0\",\"EMI\",\"0\",\"ENM\",\"0\",\"ENSGLOSS\",\"0\",\"ENVO\",\"0\",\"EPIO\",\"0\",\"EUPATH\",\"0\",\"EXMO\",\"0\",\"ExO\",\"0\",\"FAO\",\"0\",\"FBbi\",\"0\",\"FBbt\",\"0\",\"FBcv\",\"0\",\"FBdv\",\"0\",\"FIDEO\",\"0\",\"FLOPO\",\"0\",\"FMA\",\"0\",\"FOBI\",\"0\",\"FOODON\",\"0\",\"FOVT\",\"0\",\"FYPO\",\"0\",\"GALLONT\",\"0\",\"GAZ\",\"0\",\"GECKO\",\"0\",\"GENEPIO\",\"0\",\"GENO\",\"0\",\"GEO\",\"0\",\"GNO\",\"0\",\"GO\",\"0\",\"GSSO\",\"0\",\"GeXO\",\"0\",\"HANCESTRO\",\"0\",\"HAO\",\"0\",\"HBA\",\"0\",\"HCAO\",\"0\",\"HOM\",\"0\",\"HP\",\"0\",\"HSO\",\"0\",\"HTN\",\"0\",\"HsapDv\",\"0\"],\"isDefiningOntology\":[\"true\",\"93\",\"false\",\"3\"],\"ontologyId\":[\"uberon\",\"96\",\"addicto\",\"0\",\"ado\",\"0\",\"aeo\",\"0\",\"afo\",\"0\",\"afpo\",\"0\",\"agro\",\"0\",\"aism\",\"0\",\"amphx\",\"0\",\"apo\",\"0\",\"apollo_sv\",\"0\",\"aro\",\"0\",\"bao\",\"0\",\"bcgo\",\