{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1778978890431,"sessionID":"ses_1cc99a625ffei0cFSQ4yg684Kg","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"webfetch","callID":"call_AkOOo6cU36CU6X38L5lbebOC","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"url":"https://www.ebi.ac.uk/ols4/api/search?q=stria%20vascularis%20of%20cochlear%20duct&ontology=uberon","format":"text","timeout":30},"output":"{\"response\":{\"docs\":[{\"iri\":\"http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/UBERON_0002282\",\"ontology_name\":\"uberon\",\"related_synonyms\":[\"stria vascularis ductus cochlearis\",\"vascular stria of cochlear duct\"],\"ontology_prefix\":\"UBERON\",\"short_form\":\"UBERON_0002282\",\"description\":[\"The upper portion of the spiral ligament contains numerous capillary loops and small blood vessels, and is termed the stria vascularis. It produces endolymph for the scala media, one of the three fluid-filled compartments of the cochlea. [WP,unvetted].\"],\"label\":\"stria vascularis of cochlear duct\",\"obo_id\":\"UBERON:0002282\",\"type\":\"class\",\"exact_synonyms\":[\"stria vascularis\",\"psalterial cord\",\"stria vascularis of cochlea\",\"vascular stripe of cochlear duct\"]},{\"iri\":\"http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/UBERON_0007352\",\"ontology_name\":\"uberon\",\"related_synonyms\":[\"stria vascularis blood vessel\"],\"ontology_prefix\":\"UBERON\",\"short_form\":\"UBERON_0007352\",\"description\":[\"Blood vessels supplying the stria vascularis in the cochlea of the inner ear.\"],\"label\":\"stria vascularis vasculature\",\"obo_id\":\"UBERON:0007352\",\"type\":\"class\",\"exact_synonyms\":[\"stria vascularis blood vessels\"]},{\"iri\":\"http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/UBERON_0003243\",\"ontology_name\":\"uberon\",\"ontology_prefix\":\"UBERON\",\"short_form\":\"UBERON_0003243\",\"description\":[\"An epithelium that is part of a cochlear duct of membranous labyrinth [Automatically generated definition].\"],\"label\":\"epithelium of cochlear duct\",\"obo_id\":\"UBERON:0003243\",\"type\":\"class\",\"exact_synonyms\":[\"Reissner\\u0027s canal epithelial tissue\",\"Reissner\\u0027s canal epithelium\",\"cochlear duct epithelial tissue\",\"cochlear duct epithelium\",\"cochlear duct of membranous labyrinth epithelial tissue\",\"cochlear duct of membranous labyrinth epithelium\",\"epithelial tissue of Reissner\\u0027s canal\",\"epithelial tissue of cochlear duct of membranous labyrinth\",\"epithelial tissue of cochlear duct\",\"epithelium of Reissner\\u0027s canal\",\"epithelium of cochlear duct of membranous labyrinth\"]},{\"iri\":\"http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/UBERON_0001855\",\"ontology_name\":\"uberon\",\"related_synonyms\":[\"cochlear aqueduct\",\"ductus cochlearis\",\"membranous cochlea\",\"scala media\",\"scala of Loewenberg\"],\"ontology_prefix\":\"UBERON\",\"short_form\":\"UBERON_0001855\",\"description\":[\"An endolymph filled cavity inside the cochlea, located in between the scala tympani and the scala vestibuli, separated by the basilar membrane and Reissner\\u0027s membrane (the vestibular membrane) respectively. Houses the organ of Corti[WP].\"],\"label\":\"cochlear duct of membranous labyrinth\",\"obo_id\":\"UBERON:0001855\",\"type\":\"class\",\"exact_synonyms\":[\"cochlear duct\",\"Reissner\\u0027s canal\",\"Reissners canal\",\"cochlea duct\",\"scala medias\"]},{\"iri\":\"http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/UBERON_0002281\",\"ontology_name\":\"uberon\",\"related_synonyms\":[\"vestibular membrane\"],\"ontology_prefix\":\"UBERON\",\"short_form\":\"UBERON_0002281\",\"description\":[\"A membrane inside the cochlea of the inner ear. It separates scala media from scala vestibuli. Together with the basilar membrane it creates a compartment in the cochlea filled with endolymph, which is important for the function of the organ of Corti. It primarily functions as a diffusion barrier, allowing nutrients to travel from the perilymph to the endolymph of the membranous labyrinth. Histologically, the membrane is composed of two layers of flattened epithelium, separated by a basal lamina. Its structure suggests that its function is transport of fluid and electrolytes.\"],\"label\":\"vestibular membrane of cochlear duct\",\"obo_id\":\"UBERON:0002281\",\"type\":\"class\",\"exact_synonyms\":[\"Reissner membrane\",\"Reissner\\u0027s membrane\",\"membrana vestibularis ductus cochlearis\",\"paries vestibularis ductus cochlearis\",\"superior wall of cochlear duct\",\"vestibular membrane of Reissner\",\"vestibular membrane\",\"vestibular wall of cochlear duct\"]},{\"iri\":\"http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/UBERON_0028194\",\"ontology_name\":\"uberon\",\"ontology_prefix\":\"UBERON\",\"short_form\":\"UBERON_0028194\",\"broad_synonyms\":[\"spiral prominence\"],\"description\":[\"A projecting portion of the spiral ligament of the cochlea, bounding the lower edge of the stria vascularis and containing within it a blood vessel, the vas prominens.\"],\"label\":\"spiral prominence of cochlear duct\",\"obo_id\":\"UBERON:0028194\",\"type\":\"class\",\"exact_synonyms\":[\"prominentia spiralis ductus cochlearis\",\"spiral prominence of cochlea\",\"spiral prominence of cochlear duct\"]},{\"iri\":\"http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/UBERON_0013199\",\"ontology_name\":\"uberon\",\"ontology_prefix\":\"UBERON\",\"short_form\":\"UBERON_0013199\",\"broad_synonyms\":[\"stria\",\"striae\"],\"description\":[],\"label\":\"stria of neuraxis\",\"obo_id\":\"UBERON:0013199\",\"type\":\"class\",\"exact_synonyms\":[\"neuraxis stria\",\"neuraxis striae\"]},{\"iri\":\"http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/UBERON_0016555\",\"ontology_name\":\"uberon\",\"ontology_prefix\":\"UBERON\",\"short_form\":\"UBERON_0016555\",\"description\":[\"A stria of neuraxis that is part of a telencephalon.\"],\"label\":\"stria of telencephalon\",\"obo_id\":\"UBERON:0016555\",\"type\":\"class\",\"exact_synonyms\":[\"telencephalon stria\"]},{\"iri\":\"http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/UBERON_0001844\",\"ontology_name\":\"uberon\",\"related_synonyms\":[\"cochlear duct\",\"cochleae\",\"cochlear organ\",\"lagenas\"],\"ontology_prefix\":\"UBERON\",\"short_form\":\"UBERON_0001844\",\"description\":[\"The spiral-shaped bony canal in the inner ear containing the hair cells that transduce sound. Its core component is the Organ of Corti, the sensory organ of hearing, which is distributed along the partition separating fluid chambers in the coiled tapered tube of the cochlea. [WP,modified].\"],\"label\":\"cochlea\",\"obo_id\":\"UBERON:0001844\",\"type\":\"class\",\"exact_synonyms\":[\"cochlear part of bony labyrinth\",\"lagena\"]},{\"iri\":\"http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/UBERON_0001880\",\"ontology_name\":\"uberon\",\"related_synonyms\":[\"bed nuclei of the stria terminalis\",\"nucleus interstitialis striae terminalis\",\"nucleus of the stria terminalis\",\"nucleus proprius stria terminalis (bed nucleus)\"],\"ontology_prefix\":\"UBERON\",\"short_form\":\"UBERON_0001880\",\"broad_synonyms\":[\"BST\"],\"description\":[\"A brain structure in the forebrain wrapped around the stria terminalis. It\\u0027s largest extent can be found around the crossing of the anterior commissure[INCF].\"],\"label\":\"bed nucleus of stria terminalis\",\"obo_id\":\"UBERON:0001880\",\"type\":\"class\",\"exact_synonyms\":[\"intercalate nucleus of stria terminalis\",\"nuclei of stria terminalis\",\"stria terminalis nucleus\",\"bed nuclei of the stria terminalis\",\"bed nucleus of the stria terminalis\",\"bed nucleus stria terminalis (Johnson)\",\"bed nucleus striae terminalis\",\"interstitial nucleus of stria terminalis\",\"nucleus of stria terminalis\",\"nucleus striae terminalis\"]}],\"numFound\":21057,\"start\":0},\"responseHeader\":{\"QTime\":257,\"status\":0},\"facet_counts\":{\"facet_fields\":{\"ontologyPreferredPrefix\":[\"UBERON\",\"21056\",\"ADDICTO\",\"0\",\"ADO\",\"0\",\"AEO\",\"0\",\"AFO\",\"0\",\"AGRO\",\"0\",\"AISM\",\"0\",\"AMPHX\",\"0\",\"APO\",\"0\",\"APOLLO_SV\",\"0\",\"ARO\",\"0\",\"AfPO\",\"0\",\"BAO\",\"0\",\"BCIO\",\"0\",\"BCO\",\"0\",\"BFO\",\"0\",\"BMONT\",\"0\",\"BSPO\",\"0\",\"BTO\",\"0\",\"CAO\",\"0\",\"CAR