{"type":"text","timestamp":1778978912509,"sessionID":"ses_1cc99a625ffei0cFSQ4yg684Kg","part":{"id":"prt_e3367e8520015D2bjVNzq3if7l","messageID":"msg_e3367a3c1001mVii3w9w3oyTU2","sessionID":"ses_1cc99a625ffei0cFSQ4yg684Kg","type":"text","text":"The anatomy IDs are now verified locally enough to proceed: `spiral ligament` is `UBERON_0006725`, `stria vascularis of cochlear duct` is `UBERON_0002282`, `spiral prominence of cochlear duct` is `UBERON_0028194`, and `otic capsule` is `UBERON_0004637`. I’m patching the five fibrocyte classes now, keeping the change scoped to `src/ontology/cl-edit.owl`.","time":{"start":1778978908242,"end":1778978912508}}}
{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1778978912983,"sessionID":"ses_1cc99a625ffei0cFSQ4yg684Kg","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"webfetch","callID":"call_nae19rKFXVKIHEJ1k1oU9uMA","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"url":"https://www.ebi.ac.uk/ols4/api/search?q=crista%20basilaris&ontology=uberon","format":"text","timeout":30},"output":"{\"response\":{\"docs\":[{\"iri\":\"http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/UBERON_0018663\",\"ontology_name\":\"uberon\",\"ontology_prefix\":\"UBERON\",\"short_form\":\"UBERON_0018663\",\"description\":[\"An opening of the otic duct within the inner ear. The recessus basilaris can open to the saccule (in frogs) or the lagena (in salamanders and caecilians). The sensory epithelium of the recessus basilaris is the basilar papilla (or papilla basilaris). Reference: Lewis, E.R. and R.E. Lombard. 1988. The amphibian inner ear. Pp. 93-123 in Fritszch, B., et al. (eds.), The Evolution of the Amphibian Auditory System. Wiley \\u0026 Sons. [curated by D. Blackburn].\"],\"label\":\"recessus basilaris\",\"obo_id\":\"UBERON:0018663\",\"type\":\"class\",\"exact_synonyms\":[\"basilar papillar recess\"]},{\"iri\":\"http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/UBERON_3000395\",\"ontology_name\":\"uberon\",\"ontology_prefix\":\"UBERON\",\"short_form\":\"UBERON_3000395\",\"description\":[],\"label\":\"pars basilaris\",\"obo_id\":\"UBERON:3000395\",\"type\":\"class\"},{\"iri\":\"http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/UBERON_0004721\",\"ontology_name\":\"uberon\",\"related_synonyms\":[\"ampullary crest\",\"cristae ampullares\"],\"ontology_prefix\":\"UBERON\",\"short_form\":\"UBERON_0004721\",\"description\":[\"The crista ampullaris is the sensory organ of rotation located in the semicircular canal of the inner ear. The function of the crista ampullaris is to sense angular acceleration and deceleration.\"],\"label\":\"crista ampullaris\",\"obo_id\":\"UBERON:0004721\",\"type\":\"class\",\"exact_synonyms\":[\"ampullary crest of semicircular duct\"]},{\"iri\":\"http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/UBERON_0005979\",\"ontology_name\":\"uberon\",\"ontology_prefix\":\"UBERON\",\"short_form\":\"UBERON_0005979\",\"description\":[\"The vertical crest of the interior wall of the right atrium that lies to the right of the sinus of the vena cava and separates this from the remainder of the right atrium.\"],\"label\":\"crista terminalis\",\"obo_id\":\"UBERON:0005979\",\"type\":\"class\",\"exact_synonyms\":[\"crista terminalis atrii dextri\",\"crista terminalis cordis\",\"crista terminalis of right atrium\"]},{\"iri\":\"http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/UBERON_3000110\",\"ontology_name\":\"uberon\",\"ontology_prefix\":\"UBERON\",\"short_form\":\"UBERON_3000110\",\"description\":[\"Thin, horizontal ridge that extends medially from the corpus of the septomaxilla; it lays on the lamina inferior.\"],\"label\":\"crista contacta\",\"obo_id\":\"UBERON:3000110\",\"type\":\"class\"},{\"iri\":\"http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/UBERON_3000113\",\"ontology_name\":\"uberon\",\"ontology_prefix\":\"UBERON\",\"short_form\":\"UBERON_3000113\",\"description\":[\"Paired, oblique plates of cartilage located ventral to the alary cartilages. The dorsomedial margin of each crista intermedia is fused to the transitional zone between the septum nasi and the tectum nasi, whereas the ventrolateral margin bears two laminae, the lamina superior and the lamina inferior.\"],\"label\":\"crista intermedia\",\"obo_id\":\"UBERON:3000113\",\"type\":\"class\"},{\"iri\":\"http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/UBERON_3000117\",\"ontology_name\":\"uberon\",\"related_synonyms\":[\"subnasal crest\"],\"ontology_prefix\":\"UBERON\",\"short_form\":\"UBERON_3000117\",\"description\":[\"Ventral crest of the paries nasi.\"],\"label\":\"crista subnasalis\",\"obo_id\":\"UBERON:3000117\",\"type\":\"class\"},{\"iri\":\"http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/UBERON_3000118\",\"ontology_name\":\"uberon\",\"ontology_prefix\":\"UBERON\",\"short_form\":\"UBERON_3000118\",\"description\":[\"Short and blunt process that extends posteriorly from the posteromedial margin of the postnasal wall, on the anterodorsal corner of the orbit above the medial orbitonasal foramen.\"],\"label\":\"crista supraorbitalis\",\"obo_id\":\"UBERON:3000118\",\"type\":\"class\"},{\"iri\":\"http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/UBERON_3000647\",\"ontology_name\":\"uberon\",\"ontology_prefix\":\"UBERON\",\"short_form\":\"UBERON_3000647\",\"description\":[\"Sharp ridge that extends medially from the basal part of the processus infrafenestralis; it separates the diverticulum proncipale from the diverticulum medium.\"],\"label\":\"crista interna\",\"obo_id\":\"UBERON:3000647\",\"type\":\"class\"},{\"iri\":\"http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/UBERON_3000648\",\"ontology_name\":\"uberon\",\"ontology_prefix\":\"UBERON\",\"short_form\":\"UBERON_3000648\",\"description\":[\"Synchondrotic or synostotic connection between the footplate of the pars media plectri and the ventral margin of the fenestra ovalis.\"],\"label\":\"crista praeopercularis\",\"obo_id\":\"UBERON:3000648\",\"type\":\"class\"}],\"numFound\":77,\"start\":0},\"responseHeader\":{\"QTime\":107,\"status\":0},\"facet_counts\":{\"facet_fields\":{\"ontologyPreferredPrefix\":[\"UBERON\",\"77\",\"ADDICTO\",\"0\",\"ADO\",\"0\",\"AEO\",\"0\",\"AFO\",\"0\",\"AGRO\",\"0\",\"AISM\",\"0\",\"AMPHX\",\"0\",\"APO\",\"0\",\"APOLLO_SV\",\"0\",\"ARO\",\"0\",\"AfPO\",\"0\",\"BAO\",\"0\",\"BCIO\",\"0\",\"BCO\",\"0\",\"BFO\",\"0\",\"BMONT\",\"0\",\"BSPO\",\"0\",\"BTO\",\"0\",\"CAO\",\"0\",\"CARO\",\"0\",\"CCF\",\"0\",\"CCO\",\"0\",\"CDAO\",\"0\",\"CDNO\",\"0\",\"CHEBI\",\"0\",\"CHEMINF\",\"0\",\"CHIRO\",\"0\",\"CHMO\",\"0\",\"CIDO\",\"0\",\"CIO\",\"0\",\"CL\",\"0\",\"CLAO\",\"0\",\"CLO\",\"0\",\"CLYH\",\"0\",\"CMO\",\"0\",\"CMPO\",\"0\",\"COB\",\"0\",\"COLAO\",\"0\",\"COVOC\",\"0\",\"CPONT\",\"0\",\"CRO\",\"0\",\"CTENO\",\"0\",\"CVDO\",\"0\",\"DDANAT\",\"0\",\"DDPHENO\",\"0\",\"DHBA\",\"0\",\"DIDEO\",\"0\",\"DISDRIV\",\"0\",\"DMBA\",\"0\",\"DOID\",\"0\",\"DRON\",\"0\",\"DUO\",\"0\",\"EC\",\"0\",\"ECAO\",\"0\",\